// H64 Pixel: an original 5x7 bitmap face drawn for Hermes64 Studio (all caps).
// Glyphs are authored here row by row; nothing is traced from another font.
// Output is SVG path data made of 1x1 squares, so text stays crisp at any scale
// (shape-rendering: crispEdges) and colour comes from CSS (fill: currentColor).

